# Swift Alliance mechanostrider from Milli Featherwhistle (Steelgrill's Depot).
# Sources: Forever client 1.60.1.70338 tables via wago.tools (ItemSparse: level,
# price, races, riding spell; SkillLineAbility: Riding); npcs.json and
# items.json for the trainer, the vendor and its stock.
# Forever riding: one Riding skill (Apprentice 75 from level 40, Journeyman 150
# at 60). Training costs 100g and 1,000g (Forever's world data: the trainers of
# Velma Warnam and Genn Fairweather, build 70124) and comes with a mount
# (Blizzard). ItemSparse lists the mounts at 20g (level 40) and 200g (level 60)
# for every race of the faction, but each one also needs Mechanostrider Piloting (10907;
# MountCapability), which SkillLineAbility gives only Gnomes with Riding: the
# faction's other races and the Skyborne must learn it.
# ASSUMED: Binjy Featherwhistle teaches it to them at Exalted with Gnomeregan Exiles (Classic
# rule; a beta player guide says other races' mounts need Exalted). In-game
# check: a Human at Binjy Featherwhistle, with and without Exalted.
# ASSUMED: Honored with your race's home city takes 10% off training and mounts
# (beta player guides; Classic had the same). In-game check: the price at Honored.

step Journeyman Riding
  zone Dun Morogh
  tip Steelgrill's Depot is just east of Kharanos; Binjy Featherwhistle stands beside Milli Featherwhistle's mechanostriders. At 60 Binjy Featherwhistle teaches Journeyman Riding to Gnomes for 1,000g (10% less at Honored with Gnomeregan Exiles); Blizzard says it comes with a mount. Other races train it at their own race's riding trainer. Each swift mechanostrider costs 200g here.
  level 60
  train 7954 only Gnome               -- Binjy Featherwhistle, riding trainer
  skill Riding 150

step Mechanostrider Piloting for other races
  only Human,Dwarf,NightElf,Skyborne
  when !knows 10907
  tip Any Alliance race can buy these mechanostriders, but riding one also takes Mechanostrider Piloting, which only Gnomes get with Riding. Binjy Featherwhistle teaches it to other races once they are Exalted with Gnomeregan Exiles (the Gnomeregan Exiles Reputation guide shows the way). Until then, don't buy a mechanostrider for this character.
  rep "Gnomeregan Exiles" Exalted
  train 7954                          -- Binjy Featherwhistle, Mechanostrider Piloting

step Pick a colour
  tip Milli Featherwhistle sells the other colours (200g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like.
  vendor 7955                         -- Milli Featherwhistle
  buy 18772 npc 7955 optional         -- Swift Green Mechanostrider, 200g
  buy 18773 npc 7955 optional         -- Swift White Mechanostrider, 200g
  buy 18774 npc 7955 optional         -- Swift Yellow Mechanostrider, 200g
